[background arg="res://assets/misc/black.png" fade="0.0"]
join whale center
whale: Hi Ms.Mone, Mr.Ker ! Welcome to WhaleBack, though I'm pained it had to be in such troubled times. Nonetheless I must thank you for answering our call for help !
join anemon leftmost [animation="Instant In"]
anemon: Thanks ! I always wanted to visit a caring home !
whale: ...
[wait time="1.0"]
whale: As you know our cherished Shrimp passed away recently.
update whale (Crying)
whale: [i]whwawhahwhaw[/i]
update whale (Main)
whale: I'm sorry. It's just, I liked her so much! Every time I think of her death I tear up. Especially since I fear her death was not of natural causes.
whale: We found her dead in the library, her crushed body is still there should you want to inspect it. I locked down the caring home as soon as her corpse was found. No one has come in or out since.
leave whale [animation="Fade Out Down"]
update anemon (Alone) [animation="Instant In"]
join joe right
anemon (Alone): So Joe, happy to be here ?
joe: Locked up in a caring home along a dead body and murderer, how could I not. We're here to solve a murder Anne, not have fun.
anemon (Alone): Always so gloomy ! You should try smiling some day, everything is just so much more fun that way!
joe: ...
set {NextDialogue.whale} = "meeting_whale"